Ever since then, your family’s been...

532
00:38:13,159 --> 00:38:14,639
no games allowed.

533
00:38:15,039 --> 00:38:16,119
No talking about games.

534
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:19,400
So that means ever since that happened,

535
00:38:20,599 --> 00:38:23,280
you really haven’t touched a game at all?

536
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,280
The last game I ever played...

537
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:28,960
What game was it?

538
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,960
Mm...

539
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:37,800
Kao, Kao, Kao.

540
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:39,480
- Get down, get down.
- Hey, hey, hey.

541
00:38:39,920 --> 00:38:41,518
The upstairs is dead go downstairs.

542
00:38:41,519 --> 00:38:43,159
- Kao can stay upstairs.
- No, downstairs.

543
00:38:43,519 --> 00:38:45,759
How do I pick up the gun?
The gun, the gun where’s the gun?

544
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:47,000
Just shoot first.

545
00:38:47,599 --> 00:38:48,599
The big gun’s here.

546
