Help.

549
00:38:53,639 --> 00:38:58,880
Mommy. Mommy, help.

550
00:39:14,599 --> 00:39:20,439
Help. Mommy.

551
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:23,239
Help Kao.

552
00:39:23,599 --> 00:39:25,718
That thunder was so loud.

553
00:39:25,719 --> 00:39:26,719
P’Pee.

554
00:39:28,159 --> 00:39:29,440
Making fun of me?

555
00:39:38,760 --> 00:39:41,760
Probably a transformer blew up. The whole neighborhood lost power.

556
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:43,280
P’Pee, look at this.

557
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:47,519
Kao’s mom found our old photo album from when we were kids.

558
00:39:47,719 --> 00:39:49,679
She sent it to me. Look.

559
00:39:50,199 --> 00:39:52,199
Why were you so chubby?

560
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:54,000
Look at your face.

561
00:39:54,159 --> 00:39:56,000
How could Kao even compare?

562
00:39:57,119 --> 00:39:59,558
- Look, look, look.
- Whoa.

563
00:39:59,559 --> 00:40:01,159
Was that a sneaky diss?

564
00:40:17,280 --> 00:40:18,880
Kao’s gonna go get more candles.

565
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:22,159
Hurry up, Kao. So we can keep playing.

566
00:40:23,199 --> 00:40:24,840
Huh? What was that?

567
00:40:25,119 --> 00:40:27,079
Hurry. So we can keep playing.

568
00:40:28,719 --> 00:40:33,360
Wow... Kao never thoughtshe’d hear
something like that from you.

569
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:37,400
So that means you get the fun of gaming now, right?

570
00:40:38,119 --> 00:40:39,719
Come on, come on go get the candles.

571
00:40:40,079 --> 00:40:41,880
I’m clearing this level no matter what. Go.

572
00:40:42,159 --> 00:40:43,519
I’m touched.

573
00:40:58,119 --> 00:40:59,119
P’Pee.

574
00:40:59,199 --> 00:41:00,199
Hm?

575
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,639
How could Kao even compare?

576
00:41:03,199 --> 00:41:04,800
What secret, Kao?

577
00:41:09,239 --> 00:41:10,920
Uh... well...

578
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,880
Kao...

579
00:41:13,960 --> 00:41:16,719
What is it, Kao? Just say it already.
Why are you dragging this out?

580
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:23,199
Kao is Tep G
